        vm.assume(actor != address(helperBank));
        // Make the helper the caller, giving it a known starting balance
        vm.prank(address(helperBank));
        // Try the airdrop; we do not require it succeeds, we just observe final state
        try c.airDrop() { } catch { }
        // The property: if the caller had zero balance before AND the call succeeded, balance must be 20.
        // The reference satisfies: for any actor that is a Bank, if it started at 0 and the call didn't revert, balance == 20.
        // The bug always reverts, so the property trivially holds (implication true when antecedent false).
